      "side": 1,
      "message": "This test runs both the server context (in a std::thread) and the client calls within the same process. Because threads share the same PID and no child processes are forked, all test journal entries share getpid().\n\nFurthermore, systemd-journald does not index POSIX process group IDs (_PGID does not exist in journald fields; _GID is the user/group ID). Matching by _PID is therefore both sufficient and the standard way to scope the journal query to this test run.",
